      "content": "The thought that your absence would somehow relieve their suffering is a very dark and heavy conclusion, but it is a thought rooted in exhaustion, not reality. Your life has inherent value, and the pain you feel is immense, but ending it will not erase the difficult times; it will only create permanent, unimaginable grief for them. Please, let someone help you carry this burden right now; you don't have to face this overwhelming feeling alone.",
