    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but they'd be so much happier. they're constantly walking on eggshells around me because of how much i've messed up. wouldn't it be more selfish to keep dragging them through my mess instead of just letting them move on? it feels like the only selfless thing left to do is to just be gone.",
